      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description:\n\n[Shot 1 | 00:00-00:01.2]\nCinematic photorealistic close two-shot inside a stylish apartment at night. Two young adult women face each other at close range. The Korean woman has the polished appearance of a high-level K-pop idol: elegant oval face, flawless luminous skin, large expressive eyes, long dark glossy hair, refined makeup, stylish fashionable outfit, immaculate grooming, and a highly photogenic appearance. She looks visibly nervous and guilty, avoiding her blonde friend's eyes.\n\n[Shot 2 | 00:01.2-00:03.0]\nThe Korean woman takes a breath, looks directly at her blonde friend, and nervously says: \"I slept with your boyfriend.\" Her voice is quiet, ashamed, and emotionally tense. Keep her face clearly visible during the entire line for accurate lip synchronization.\n\n[Shot 3 | 00:03.0-00:05.0]\nThe blonde woman immediately reacts in stunned disbelief. Her eyes widen and her expression shifts from confusion to shock. She looks directly at the Korean woman and loudly says: \"You did what?!\" Hold clearly on the blonde woman's face during the dialogue for accurate lip synchronization. End on her shocked expression with a subtle rapid camera push-in.\n\nVisual style: photorealistic live-action, realistic human anatomy, natural skin texture, realistic hair and fabric, cinematic low-light apartment lighting, believable facial expressions, subtle handheld camera movement, natural eye movement, realistic acting.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nQuiet apartment room tone, subtle breathing, slight clothing movement. The Korean woman's confession is clearly audible. A brief silence immediately follows her confession before the blonde woman's shocked response.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nNo music.\n",
        768,
        768,
        56
